      "trackName": "WristBlock: Block Puzzle Game",
      "description": "WatchTetris: Block Puzzle Games\nWatchTetris brings the most beloved block puzzle challenges to your smartwatch. Designed specifically for wearable devices, this collection features:\n\t•\tClassic Mode: The timeless block stacking and clearing experience.\n\t•\tSand Mode: A unique twist where blocks turn into sand upon landing.\n\t•\tMatch-up Mode: A block-themed connection game to test your logic. Focus on the core gameplay and challenge your own high score. Stay tuned for future updates featuring even more block-themed game modes. Perfect for quick entertainment on your wrist anytime, anywhere.",
